# Update `frontend/screens.md` After Screen Implementation

When implementing or completing backend integration for any frontend screen/route:

- Update `frontend/screens.md` in the same task.
- For the affected screen, adjust:
  - status (`Implemented`, `Partially implemented`, `Mocked`, or `Stubbed`)
  - "Already implemented"
  - "To implement"
- If behavior changed, update the "Required integration tests" section with any new or modified cases.
- Do not mark a screen fully implemented unless its backend data/mutations are wired and used in UI flow.

Before finalizing:

1. Confirm every edited screen has a corresponding `frontend/screens.md` update.
2. Keep ordering and route names consistent with `app/App.js`.
